{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0044248 cellular catabolic process \nsee (https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29627#event-16124587346)\n\nIt will be replaced by/merged into: GO:0009056 catabolic process\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1SOseRxmbsX8-MhfUhYlinuadCL_fzbIoys-ox1dLcf8/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n~PomBase 1~ fixed\nPseudoCAP 3\nWormbase 1\n\nNo mappings\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-01-31T19:06:05Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0044248 cellular catabolic process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-01-31T21:34:10Z"}
